me":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"I2YZuyG1KjiTbtwfNFHaOQ","review_id":"yQBrX1sqEP54JLbdE0AzvQ","date":"2018-06-22T21:27:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9324915409088135,"text_excerpt":"This was my favorite place to stop for a drink. It is owned by Villalobos Rescue which is primarily Pitbulls. Nice inside and the drinks were very good. My husband had to drag me out of the place. They also have food and we had the Fried Green Tomatoes. The best we had on the trip. Everyone is very nice and friendly. If this bar was in my hometown I'd for sure be there. Cheers"},{"business_id":"I2YZuyG1KjiTbtwfNFHaOQ","review_id":"7b2_W1M5RIgLg94y6fRd9g","date":"2018-02-11T03:21:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9217532873153687,"text_excerpt":"Great food and good drinks! Good cause too! Definitely worth stopping at. We tried to get into the sports bar next door for the NFL playoffs but it was packed. We found ourselves at Tahyo and spent most of the day there. The drinks were so good, the food fresh and delicious, and the staff friendly. Would absolutely go back if ever in NOLA again."},{"business_id":"I2YZuyG1KjiTbtwfNFHaOQ","review_id":"kFQXun4cfh3kn0QZrqExcA","date":"2019-12-21T16:21:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9216906428337097,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I stopped in last night, only intending to have a drink at the bar. The menu had so many interesting choices that we ended up having dinner. It was great. We started with the Brussel sprouts appetizer. It was a huge bowl of crispy, lime flavored, perfectly cooked sprouts. Enough for a meal on it's own. My wife had the mac and cheese. Again, it was a generous portion that she couldn't finish, but she really enjoyed it. I had \"Mariah's Muffuletta Veggie Burger\" prepared with a plant-based Beyond burger. First, kudos for having a meat free option on the menu. Second, thanks for knowing how to prepare this burger; crispy on the outside, just delicious. I was almost tempted to brea..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"I2YZuyG1KjiTbtwfNFHaOQ","photo_id":"aTf5s-f9GePgK1aovXoOXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aTf5s-f9GePgK1aovXoOXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
